\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {25}{\ignorespaces Error of the reconstructions of $S_0$ against $\varepsilon $ (log--log, $N=128$). Near $P$ the interpolation decreases with the same slope as the endpoints ($\tfrac  12$ on both surfaces); away from $P$ it drops much faster until it reaches the accuracy of a triangle mesh with spacing $h$. The SDF interpolation recovers the double cone almost exactly for $G=1$ (left), but not the Fermat cone for $G=x$ (right).}}{60}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:interp-eps}{{25}{60}{}{figure.25}{}}
